  "label": "Accusation of Obama's Silence on Mueller Report",
  "description": "A false and politically motivated claim that former President Barack Obama has remained silent or avoided commenting on the Mueller Report. This is used in the meme to imply disloyalty or complicity, despite Obama having publicly supported the investigation and expressed concern over the report's findings, particularly regarding obstruction of justice by Trump.",
